{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa Works the Evening Shift", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Making a Change", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Conditional Sentences", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">zero conditional</span> for facts and generalities \u2013 things that are always true. Where the condition is met, there is only one possible outcome. This happens every time. You are not focusing on the future. <br/><br/> This is different from other conditional sentences, something can be likely to happen, or unlikely to happen when the condition is met in the future.<br>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "For example: <br> <span class=\"italic\">If you heat water, it boils.<br> If I go to be earlier, I feel more rested. </span><br><br> Form: <br> If + Present Simple tense, Present Simple", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">first conditional</span> when the condition is possible.<br><br> For example: <br> <span class=\"italic\">If it starts to rain, I'll take an umbrella. <br> If you get tired, we'll stop and sit for a while. </span><br><br> Form: <br> If + Present Simple, will", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">second conditional </span>when the condition is impossible or unlikely.<br><br> For example: <br><span class=\"italic\"> If I were you, I wouldn't talk to her again.<br> If I won some money, I would take a trip. </span><br><br> Form: <br> If + Past Simple, would", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Note that you need a comma when you write the condition before the result.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " If it rains, the streets will get wet.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When it rains, the streets get wet.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If you ride your bike, you get there faster.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If I won the lottery, I would buy a new house.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " I would buy a new house if I won the lottery.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If I had a chauffeur, I wouldn't have to walk.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "exhausted", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be so tired that you have no energy left", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sally is exhausted from her demanding job.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about healthy or unhealthy situations at work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "beat", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an informal way to say you're tired", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter is beat because he just came back from the gym.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "relief", "type": "name"}, {"content": "when something unpleasant or painful has gone away", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If Sally went to the gym, she would get some relief from her stress.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to overwork ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "working overtime on a regular basis", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If Peter became the boss, he would not overwork his employees.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "optimal", "type": "name"}, {"content": "at the best level", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If people are overworked, they can't be productive at an optimal level.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to get back at", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to return to a task you were doing a little while ago", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You've had a long break, so you'd better get back at it. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "With a partner, discuss what positive changes you would make related to your job and work. You can talk about free time, money, your job, or any other aspect of jobs and work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write two conditional sentences for each area. For example: <span class=\"italic\">If I could have any job, I would be a ...</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your sentences to your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss your ideas.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about jobs and work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write conditional sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about my wishes.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le06ob05re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob05re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey, Sally. How are you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, hi, Peter. I'm exhausted. I just came home from work. How are you doing?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, I'm pretty beat too. I just came back from the gym.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If I went to the gym, I might feel less stressed."}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob05re2img01.jpg", "time": "21000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Are you eating and sleeping well? It's imperative that you stay healthy if your days are so demanding.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're right. If I take the time, I can cook nutritious meals. If I went to bed earlier, I would feel more rested the next day. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I find that when I go to the gym even for just 30 minutes, I feel invigorated."}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob05re2img02.jpg", "time": "41000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I agree. If I eat better, my body has more energy. My boss is always so demanding.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: If I became the boss, I would treat all my employees fairly and not overwork them. Ultimately, people are unhappy if they're overworked. If employees are unhappy, they aren't as productive.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: All I know is, if I won the lottery, I would go back to Africa. Well, I'd better get back at it.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Try not to stay up too late."}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le06ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le06ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs, work, and staying healthy. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about cause and effect. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about wishes and imaginary situations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Are there any problems with your work or school routine you wish you could change?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What changes would you make in your life?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "